    {
      "speaker": "プロデューサー",
      "text": "（角色登场与环境铺垫——みんなの様子を確かめながら、声をかけた）",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_01",
        "zh": "（角色登场与环境铺垫——一边确认大家的状态，一边上前搭话）",
        "speakerZh": "制作人",
        "note": "[小段 1: 角色登场与环境铺垫] 角色登场与环境铺垫",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "角色登场与环境铺垫"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "真乃",
      "text": "ほわぁ……！プロデューサーさん、あそこを見てくださいっ！灯織ちゃん、めぐるちゃん、見えましたよ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "mano",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "001",
      "clothId": "001",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "surp1",
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
      "lip": "lip_trouble",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_02",
        "zh": "哇啊……！制作人先生，请看那边！灯织酱、缭酱，看到大家了哦！",
        "speakerZh": "樱木真乃",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "角色登场与环境铺垫"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "灯織",
      "text": "プロデューサー、救命具と飲料水の確認は済んでいます。真乃、めぐる、すぐに体調を確かめましょう。",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hiori",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "002",
      "clothId": "002",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "wait1",
      "charAnim2": "face_serious",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_03",
        "zh": "制作人，救生衣和饮用水的清点已经完成了。真乃、缭，立刻确认大家的身体状况吧。",
        "speakerZh": "风野灯织",
        "surfaceEmotion": "calm_neutral",
        "innerEmotion": "resolve_quiet",
        "vocalTone": "calm_even",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "角色登场与环境铺垫"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "めぐる",
      "text": "おーいっ！プロデューサー！真乃、灯織、見て見て！わたしたちの声、ちゃんと向こうまで届いてるよっ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "meguru",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "003",
      "clothId": "003",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_04",
        "zh": "喂——！制作人！真乃、灯织，快看快看！我们的声音已经稳稳传到对面去了哦！",
        "speakerZh": "八宫巡",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "角色登场与环境铺垫"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "真乃",
      "text": "えへへ、みんなの声が重なって、わたしの胸まであたたかくなりますっ。ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "mano",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "001",
      "clothId": "001",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_05",
        "zh": "嘿嘿，大家的声音重叠在一起，连我的心里都变得暖洋洋的。谢谢您，制作人先生！",
        "speakerZh": "樱木真乃",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "[小段 2: 制作人与偶像互动推进剧情] 制作人与偶像互动推进剧情",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "制作人与偶像互动推进剧情"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "灯織",
      "text": "……っ、別に、私が特別心配していたわけでは……ただ、無事で本当によかったです、プロデューサー。",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hiori",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "002",
      "clothId": "002",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 568,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "shy1",
      "charAnim2": "face_shy",
      "charAnim4": "eye_right",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
      "lip": "lip_shy",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_06",
        "zh": "……唔，我并没有特别担心得睡不着之类的……只是，大家能平安无事真的太好了，制作人。",
        "speakerZh": "风野灯织",
        "surfaceEmotion": "shy_flustered",
        "innerEmotion": "affection_bashful",
        "vocalTone": "breath_flutter",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "制作人与偶像互动推进剧情"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "めぐる",
      "text": "えへへ、みんなが揃えば百人力だねっ！わたしも全力で盛り上げていくよ、プロデューサー！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "meguru",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "003",
      "clothId": "003",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 896,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 2
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile2",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "row_07",
        "zh": "嘿嘿，只要大家聚在一起就是百人力呢！我也要全力把气氛炒热起来哦，制作人！",
        "speakerZh": "八宫巡",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "制作人与偶像互动推进剧情"
      }
    },
